<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty down vs dlr at 2.7390.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty down vs dlr at 2.7390.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 2.7390 against the dollar, down from 2.7365 on Wednesday and at 1.8530 against the mark, down from 1.8520, the NBP said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
